<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/contract-print.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="contract-print-page">
  <div class="contract-print-toolbar">
    <a href="<%= backUrl %>" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">← Retour au dossier</a>
    <a href="<%= downloadUrl %>" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Télécharger (.html)</a>
    <div class="input-group input-group-sm contract-print-copy">
      <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="contractPageUrl" readonly value="<%= pageUrl %>">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-copy-target="contractPageUrl">Copier le lien</button>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted small mb-0 w-100">
      L'impression depuis Cursor peut fermer l'application.
      <strong>Téléchargez le fichier .html</strong>, ouvrez-le dans Chrome ou Safari, puis <kbd>⌘P</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+P</kbd> → Enregistrer en PDF.
    </p>
  </div>

  <main class="contract-print-main">
    <%- include('partials/service-contract-document', { event, contract, subcontractorLabel }) %>
  </main>

  <script src="/js/contract-print.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
